comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-24T08:32:19.516Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: all-status searches for 1294 and plugin release version fixture found no owner of this staging omission; pm-l9wl is closed for the delivered exact-version resolver and stays closed. Live evidence: auto-release run 35971453730 and publish run 35973749511; failure reproduced from the committed manifest inventory."
  "2026-09-24T08:36:58.486Z","harness:codex","TDD evidence: the new staging regression failed with both runtime package.json paths absent (33 existing tests passed). Shared distribution inventory now drives sync and release git add; a fresh pre-commit version check refuses drift. Focused pipeline/sync/cooldown tests pass. Existing exact-tag recovery explicitly refuses changed source for unpublished immutable tags, so v2026.9.24 remains unchanged; next daily release can carry the reviewed correction."
  "2026-09-24T08:45:14.821Z","harness:codex","Live operational evidence: Sentry one-day window checked successfully with 0 critical/high issues; required telemetry gate passed at 0.43 percent errors and 0 failures lacking error codes. Independent freshness query at 08:43:47 UTC saw latest event 08:43:20 UTC and 190 events in 15 minutes; RabbitMQ events queue had 0 ready and 0 unacknowledged messages. These are live operational observations, not proof that unpublished v2026.9.24 reached consumers."
  "2026-09-24T08:47:20.559Z","harness:codex","Temporary installed-artifact verification passed for copied Claude/Codex plugins with npm unavailable after cache population; npx and bunx packed-package smoke passed for corrected checkout version 2026.9.24 across 9 packages. This validates the local corrected tarball, not the existing immutable tag or npm publication."
  "2026-09-24T08:58:07.837Z","harness:codex","Verification: PR #1295 hosted coverage artifact from run 35977528916 has exact 100/100/100/100: lines 62249/62249, statements 65109/65109, functions 13498/13498, branches 49725/49725, zero skipped counters. Four linked item suites pass. Initial local broad run exposed two now-corrected script contract expectations and a load-related census timeout; all 64 focused rerun tests passed without loosening timeouts."
  "2026-09-24T09:15:47.550Z","harness:codex","Validated CodeRabbit thread 4091860052: absent/null/non-string plugin runtime pins bypassed the optional slot census. New negative tests reproduced the defect. Both plugin package manifests now require string versions and runtime pins; ordinary drift remains synchronized and check rejects stale exact pins. The orchestration regression proves a version-check refusal occurs before git add, commit, tag or push."
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-24T08:45:17.327Z","harness:codex","Release recovery boundary: preserve immutable v2026.9.24. Its unpublished source has stale plugin pins, and the current exact-tag recovery deliberately selects that source. Ship the fix on main; do not retag or publish changed source under that tag. Verify the next scheduled release separately."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-24T08:39:40.978Z","harness:codex",A version synchronizer and release git-add allowlist must share one inventory. Working-tree validation cannot detect omitted staged artifacts; assert committed manifest bytes in a real temporary Git repository.
